  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "31197616",
      "title": "Further Improvements with useWindowDimensions",
      "lectureOrder": 87,
      "videoOrder": 84,
      "sourceHash": "2df5cdde101d021d3ce8b0664257d0b155bd98b496540c31728e76dd72cc593f",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.09,
          "end": 5.27,
          "en": "So let's now work on this game over screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 5.27,
          "end": 7.74,
          "en": "At the moment, it doesn't look that good here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.74,
          "end": 11.54,
          "en": "And I think an easy way of improving the way it looks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.54,
          "end": 15.61,
          "en": "is to shrink the image a bit more and make it scrollable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 15.61,
          "end": 18.88,
          "en": "so that we can always reach this new game button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 18.88,
          "end": 21.57,
          "en": "even if it would be outside of the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.57,
          "end": 23.733,
          "en": "And at the moment that is not possible.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.76,
          "end": 26.67,
          "en": "Now, actually in the game over screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 26.67,
          "end": 30.26,
          "en": "we are already setting the image width and height",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.26,
          "end": 33.24,
          "en": "but at the moment we're only changing it based on the width",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.24,
          "end": 37.68,
          "en": "and we probably also wanna take the height into account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 37.68,
          "end": 39.04,
          "en": "We also wanna make sure that",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.04,
          "end": 41.07,
          "en": "if the device orientation changes,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 41.07,
          "end": 43.67,
          "en": "we adjust the image size.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.67,
          "end": 45.04,
          "en": "Now to do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.04,
          "end": 49.04,
          "en": "we can use this other form of the dimensions API.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 49.04,
          "end": 52.793,
          "en": "We can use the useWindowDimensions hook instead.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 54.14,
          "end": 55.56,
          "en": "So now instead of setting",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 55.56,
          "end": 58.77,
          "en": "the width, height, and border radius down there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 58.77,
          "end": 60.49,
          "en": "we now wanna do this dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 60.49,
          "end": 61.72,
          "en": "in the component function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 61.72,
          "end": 65.44,
          "en": "to react to changes in these values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 65.44,
          "end": 67.82,
          "en": "We do, of course, also wanna get rid of that code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 67.82,
          "end": 69.61,
          "en": "And here I'm just commenting it out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 69.61,
          "end": 71.193,
          "en": "so that we can still see it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 72.48,
          "end": 75.32,
          "en": "So now inside of the game over screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 75.32,
          "end": 78.21000000000001,
          "en": "we can of course use this hook to get",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 78.21000000000001,
          "end": 82.59,
          "en": "the width and the height of this screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 82.59,
          "end": 84.373,
          "en": "of this size like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.2,
          "end": 88.473,
          "en": "And now we can use this width and height",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 88.473,
          "end": 90.58,
          "en": "to adjust the image size.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 90.58,
          "end": 94.88,
          "en": "For this we can set a imageSize of 300 as a default",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 95.87,
          "end": 97.82,
          "en": "and then we can add a if statement",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 97.82,
          "end": 100.72,
          "en": "to calculate various alternatives.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 100.72,
          "end": 105.72,
          "en": "For example, if the width is smaller than 380,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 105.82,
          "end": 108.25,
          "en": "which was the check we had before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 108.25,
          "end": 113.25,
          "en": "then we might want to use a image size of 150",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 115.00999999999999,
          "end": 116.46000000000001,
          "en": "and I'll use the image size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 116.46000000000001,
          "end": 118.17,
          "en": "for both the width and height later,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 118.17,
          "end": 120.483,
          "en": "and also for calculating the radius.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 122.01,
          "end": 125.31,
          "en": "But we also know that if the height is maybe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 125.31,
          "end": 130.31,
          "en": "smaller than 380 or smaller than 400, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 130.75,
          "end": 134.23,
          "en": "then we also wanna make this smaller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 134.23,
          "end": 138.293,
          "en": "Then we might want to set the image size to just 80.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 139.85,
          "end": 143.7,
          "en": "And then we got a certain image style here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 143.7,
          "end": 145.53,
          "en": "which in the end sets a width",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.53,
          "end": 147.78,
          "en": "which is equal to the image size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 147.78,
          "end": 151.2,
          "en": "and a height which is equal to the image size",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 151.2,
          "end": 154.5,
          "en": "and which sets a border radius",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.39,
          "end": 158.563,
          "en": "which is image size divided by two.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.9,
          "end": 162.56,
          "en": "And now it's this image style that should be merged",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 162.56,
          "end": 165.03,
          "en": "with the other image styles dynamically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 165.03,
          "end": 166.5,
          "en": "on that container though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 166.5,
          "end": 168.42000000000002,
          "en": "because it was that container",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 168.42000000000002,
          "end": 171.913,
          "en": "on which we set width, height, and border radius before.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 173.233,
          "end": 174.07,
          "en": "Now we don't wanna override it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 174.07,
          "end": 176.56,
          "en": "because we're still setting some other styles in there",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 176.56,
          "end": 179.3,
          "en": "but we wanna merge in our new styles.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 179.3,
          "end": 182.06,
          "en": "So therefore, again, we can wrap this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 182.06,
          "end": 183.66,
          "en": "into an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.66,
          "end": 187.47,
          "en": "and then simply add our image style object to that array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.47,
          "end": 190.793,
          "en": "so that these styles will also be taken into account.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 191.97,
          "end": 193.94,
          "en": "With this, the image is smaller.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 193.94,
          "end": 196.46,
          "en": "But if we rotate, it gets bigger again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 196.46,
          "end": 198.593,
          "en": "So this works the way it should here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 199.46,
          "end": 200.7,
          "en": "Now, in addition, as mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 200.7,
          "end": 203.68,
          "en": "we might want to make this all scrollable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 203.68,
          "end": 205.02,
          "en": "even though it's not needed here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 205.02,
          "end": 207.71,
          "en": "but it could be needed on some devices.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 207.71,
          "end": 212.6,
          "en": "And therefore we can also include the scroll view here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 212.6,
          "end": 216.64,
          "en": "and import that and add this as a wrapper",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 216.64,
          "end": 219.5,
          "en": "around this entire screen in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 219.5,
          "end": 223.8,
          "en": "So we wrap the root view with this scroll view.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 223.8,
          "end": 227.15,
          "en": "And now we just wanna make sure that we set flex: 1",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 227.15,
          "end": 230.32,
          "en": "on this scroll view here again.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 230.32,
          "end": 234.5,
          "en": "So we add style and set this equal to styles.screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 234.5,
          "end": 237.333,
          "en": "maybe again, which we have yet to add.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 238.42000000000002,
          "end": 240.89,
          "en": "And then we add a new style object here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 240.89,
          "end": 243.84,
          "en": "the screen object, as we did it before,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 243.84,
          "end": 247.193,
          "en": "where we set flex: 1 like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 248.81,
          "end": 252.08,
          "en": "With that, this now also is scrollable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 252.08,
          "end": 253.55,
          "en": "even though it's not needed here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 253.55,
          "end": 255.783,
          "en": "but we could scroll if we would need it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 256.75,
          "end": 259.88,
          "en": "And with that, we also fixed that game over screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 259.88,
          "end": 264.31,
          "en": "And now we should be able to use all these screens here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 264.31,
          "end": 268.09,
          "en": "and play this game on different screen sizes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 268.09,
          "end": 270.54,
          "en": "even though it might still be best on portrait,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 270.54,
          "end": 273.573,
          "en": "but it now also works on different screen sizes.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
